   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Governance & Data Lineage:** Records from 2026-01 onward are synthetic refresh batches made by our oversampling step. Step changes in early 2026 come from that generator, not from business performance.  \n**Metric Contracts (hover `(i)` on panels for details):** **Fast / slow medicine**: Rank of all medicines by packs sold: top 10 = Fast, bottom 10 = Slow | Grain: Packs; one row per medicine (SCD2 versions merged by MedicineID) | Target: None set | Exclusions: Only 3 of 63 medicines have ColdChainFlag = Y, so cold chain is shown as a flag | **Change vs previous refresh**: Value after the latest BI refresh minus value after the refresh before it | Grain: Same unit as the KPI | Target: n/a | Exclusions: First refresh has no previous value"
   }
  }
